                        <p>Mary Morgan was a friend of <persName key="COL01">Coleridge's</persName>. She was married to <persName key="MOR06">John Morgan</persName>, Bristol lawyer, (son of a wealthy family of wine importers) who also appears in the diary.</p>
                        <p>All instances of M Morgan and some instances of Morgan have been coded as Mary Morgan.</p>
                        <p>Other occurrences of Morgan in the diary may correspond to Mary.</p>
